          </a>
          <a href="/portafolio" class="border-2 border-neon-purple px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-neon-purple font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-neon-purple hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105">
            <span data-es="Ver Proyectos Reales" data-en="View Real Projects">Ver Proyectos Reales</span>
